  "node_type": "statement",
  "body": {
    "id": "prop:tree-reduction",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "If \\(q=0\\), then \\(R\\) has no columns, \\(h_{\\mathrm{CM}}=h^{\\star}\\), \\(\\widehat\\theta_{\\mathrm{eff}}=\\widehat\\theta_{\\mathrm{CM}}\\), and \\(\\Gamma=0\\). Within the maintained model, the canonical acyclic support \\(C=\\{2,\\infty\\}\\) has \\(q=0\\) for every fixed \\(T\\ge3\\), and on \\(\\mathcal E_N\\), \\[\\widehat\\theta_{\\mathrm{eff}}=\\widehat\\theta_{\\mathrm{CM}}=\\frac{\\sum_{t=2}^T\\overline Y_{2t}}{\\overline Y_{21}\\sum_{t=2}^T(\\overline Y_{\\infty t}/\\overline Y_{\\infty1})}-1.\\]",
    "free_symbols": [
      "q",
      "R",
      "hCM",
      "hstar",
      "thetaHatEff",
